"and sentence punctuation are ignored; spelling and word order count. Partial score measures word "
"edits. Saved-target results measure transcription, not a separate meaning test. Replays and slow "
"listens are recorded separately; only submitted answers count as practice activity. "
"Writing/translation totals stay separate."
